    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tubetab Jakoboa-k kalilatetab Josep",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiing’uruk anyun Josep kotokyigei togetab kwandanyi, ak kirirji, ak kong’utut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’at Josep otwogikyik chepkerichinik konde kerichek mustab kwandanyi: ak kiinde chepkerichinichoto kerichek mustab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiigesgei betusiek artamu agobo inendet: amu tenitu choto betusiek che kicham kinde kerichek: ak kirirji Misrik inendet betusiek tamanwogik tisab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagobata betusiek che bo rirek, kong’alalji Josep bikab gotab Parao, kolenji, Ngo kianyoru chamet eng’ taing’wong’, ko kaigai omwachi Parao kogas komie eng’ itikyik, olenji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimakwa baba ayosio, ak kile, Keero, kamei: tupcha kererinnyu ne kiachopchige eng’ emetab Kanan. Ara anyun, kaigai igona atogosta awa atub baba, si aweeige. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Parao, Ui togoste, itub kwandang’ung’, ko u ye kimagun kwandang’ung’ iyosie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akiktogosta anyun Josep kwo kotub kwandanyiu: ak kitogosta koboto inendet otwogik tugul che bo Parao, ak boisiekab gonnyi, ak boisiek tugul che bo emetab Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kotab Josep komugul, ak ktupchosiekyik, ak bikab gotab kwandanyi: kobata lagokwak, ak kechirekwak ak tuga, che king’et eng’ emetab Gosen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba koboto inendet karisiek ak bik che lanyei mbartanyisiek: ki bik che chang’ kot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiit ruanyut kne kiborse ne bo Atad, ne mitei Jordan bitonin, ak kiiteiyo eng’ oloto eng’ rirek che ng’wonen che bichiien: ak king’at kerirji kwandanyi betusiekd tisab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingogeer che menyei emototo, Kanaik, rirek eng’ ruanyutab Atak, kole, Eechen rirechu eng’ Misrik: kigiguure anyun yoto Abel-Misraim, ne mitei Jordan bitonin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyachi werikyik ko u ye kiga ng’at inendet ichek: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu kisut werikyik kwo emetab Kanan, ak kitupchi kebenet ne mi mbaretab Makpela, ne kial Abraham koboto mbaret eng’ Epron Hitindet ne tokyingei Mamre, kobunji inendet, si koek oldab kererisiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagotub Josep kwandanyi, koweektagei kwo Misri, koboto tupchosiekyik, ak ktugul che kiga kotogosta koboto inendet, ye kibendid kotubei kwandanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingogeer werik che ktupcho ak Josep kole kagome kwandanywa, kole, Abere, imuchi kowechech Josep, ak kogeerwech yaitiet tugul ne kiga kiyachi inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto chito kwo oldab Josep, kolenji, King’at kwandang’ung’ ye kitomo kome, kole, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwachi Josep olenji, Kaigai inyochi kaat tupchosieguk amu bistoenywa, ak tengektanywa, amu kiyaun yaitiet: ara anyun, kisain kele, Nyoiywech kaat achek otwogikab Kamuktaindet ne bo kwandang’ung’. Ak kirir Josep ye king’aleljin icheget inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiba anyun werjoto tupcho agichek kobutyi ng’ony eng’ tainnyi; ak kolenji, Keero, achek ko ki otwogiguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Josep, Amoiywei: tos ageerege Kamuktaindet? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwek, ko kiolen kioyaiywa ne ya; ago kiyai Kamuktaindet komieit, si kosulda ko u rani, si kesor bik che chang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amata oiywei anyun nguno: abaok, koboto lagokwok. Ak kiigaigai ichek, ak kong’alalji eng’ talasiet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimeny Josep Misri, inendet ak bikab gotab kwandanyi: ak kitar Josep kenyisiek bogol ak taman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigeer Josep lagokab Epraim agoi ibinda ne bo somok: ak kigigu lagokab Makir weritab Manase eng’ kutung’oikab Josep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Josep tupchosiekyik, Negit ame: ago rutochinok iman Kamuktaindet, ak komaandak otogoste eng’ emoni obe emet ne kiiyosiechi Abraham, ak Isak, ak Jakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimach Josep kayosiet eng’ lagokab Israel, kole, Rutochinok iman Kamuktaindet, ak oib kowekyuk kotogosta koba eng’ oli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kime kanyun Josep, ne kiga kotar kenyisiek bogol ak taman: ak kiinde kerichek mustanyi, ak kiinde moinget eng’ oloto bo Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
